# The build context is copied to the daemon before anything runs, so the things
# that would make that take ten minutes are named here. node_modules is rebuilt
# inside the image from the lockfile; the speech models are hundreds of MB and
# are downloaded once onto the /data volume; release/ is a Windows installer.
node_modules
release
.git
ios
tiktok-submission
bin/whisper
bin/yt-dlp
bin/rnnoise
*.log
*.png
!src/cloud/web/icons/*.png
openapi.json
package-lock.json.bak
